    "Id": "mechdef_roughneck_RGH-JH",
    "Name": "Roughneck RGH-JH",
    "Details": "This very expensively upgraded Roughneck came from a militia man turned Solaris Gladiator. Mixed Clan and Inner Sphere tech makes this a marvel of technology, with a Battle Rifle in one hand and a heavy shield in the other. It has a MRM40 and Narc to round out its weaponry, while heavily reinforced reactive armour makes this a very tough opponent. This 'Mech was a labour of love, for both its Mechwarrior and MekTek.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_roughneck"
  },
